  "transcriber_notes": "Block extents come from region titles and geographic knowledge only; there is no locator map. Uncertain cases: Socotra (no block fits; set to coastal, low); Al Maharah (coastal districts hold most people but the desert plateau holds most land; default eastern, low); Abyan and Lahj (coastal plain vs inland mountains; default highland). Several edges fall at mid-month and were counted as half months (Highland lean Jun; Coastal lean Aug and Nov; Coastal main harvest start in Nov, measured about 42-45%; Eastern maize planting Jul-Aug)."
